// Title: Rundll32 Execution Without CommandLine Parameters
// ID: 1775e15e-b61b-4d14-a1a3-80981298085a
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-05-27
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1202
// Description: Detects suspicious start of rundll32.exe without any parameters as found in CobaltStrike beacon activity
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "\\rundll32.exe") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "\\rundll32.exe\"") OR where(CommandLine IENDSWITH "\\rundll32"))) AND NOT (((where(ParentImage ICONTAINS "\\AppData\\Local\\") OR where(ParentImage ICONTAINS "\\Microsoft\\Edge\\")))))
